// Copy this file to Signing.local.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in your own
// team ID to enable device builds. Config/Shared.xcconfig includes it
// optionally (#include?), so its absence is fine for simulator-only builds.
// Your 10-character Team ID: developer.apple.com → Account → Membership details (not the ID in the certificate name).
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
